  {
   "bbox": [
    40.8,
    686.88,
    276.96,
    769.92
   ],
   "id": "e18",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.76,
      686.88,
      276.48,
      695.52
     ],
     "text": "\u201cTaranna\u2019 is a new variety of the native grass Danthonia"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.28,
      697.92,
      276.0,
      706.08
     ],
     "text": "richardsonii. lt is distinct from the only other known variety"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.76,
      708.48,
      276.96,
      717.6
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Hume\u2019 in having a wider inflorescence and glumes, longer"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.28,
      719.52,
      276.48,
      728.16
     ],
     "text": "flag leaves and wider flag and tiller leaves. Although the culm"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.28,
      730.56,
      276.96,
      739.2
     ],
     "text": "heights of the two varieties are similar, \u201cTaranna\u2019 has a greater"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      41.28,
      741.12,
      276.48,
      748.32
     ],
     "text": "internodal distance between the first and second nodes on the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      40.8,
      751.68,
      276.96,
      760.8
     ],
     "text": "culm. At flowering the leaves of \u201cTaranna\u2019 tend to be a darker"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      40.8,
      762.72,
      147.36,
      769.92
     ],
     "text": "colour than those of \u2018Hume\u2019"
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u201cTaranna\u2019 is a new variety of the native grass Danthonia\nrichardsonii. lt is distinct from the only other known variety\n\u2018Hume\u2019 in having a wider inflorescence and glumes, longer\nflag leaves and wider flag and tiller leaves. Although the culm\nheights of the two varieties are similar, \u201cTaranna\u2019 has a greater\ninternodal distance between the first and second nodes on the\nculm. At flowering the leaves of \u201cTaranna\u2019 tend to be a darker\ncolour than those of \u2018Hume\u2019",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    303.84,
    576.96,
    539.52,
    617.76
   ],
   "id": "e19",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.32,
      576.96,
      539.52,
      585.12
     ],
     "text": "it has a wider and longer inflorescence, a longer interbranch"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      303.84,
      587.52,
      539.52,
      594.72
     ],
     "text": "distance between the first and second branches of the inflores-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      303.84,
      593.28,
      539.52,
      609.6
     ],
     "text": "cence. *Taranna\u2019 also has a longer culm and longer flag and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      304.32,
      609.12,
      492.96,
      617.76
     ],
     "text": "tiller leaves than the naturally occurring ecotypes."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
